  "idea": "Canva vs Figma: which design tool is better for marketing teams",
  "text": "Canva vs Figma: the ultimate tool decision guide for non-designers. Fast-paced teams struggle to maintain brand consistency while shipping daily marketing campaigns on tight deadlines. Choosing Figma without design training causes gridlock, while using Canva for software mockups ruins developer handoffs. Deploy Canva for rapid promotional collateral, and restrict Figma to responsive interface design and prototyping. This framework keeps creative pipelines moving cleanly.",
